<Base title="About" description="About Leonida Atlas, an independent fan project about Grand Theft Auto VI.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>Leonida Atlas is an independent fan project about Grand Theft Auto VI. It offers a personal play log, a source-linked fact list and a small rumor-versus-truth quiz.</p>
  <h2>How we handle facts</h2>
  <p>A statement only appears as a fact if we can link an official source and show the date we checked it. Anything else is labeled as a rumor or left out.</p>
  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <p>We do not use Rockstar's images, logos or text, and we do not host leaked material. See the <a href="/disclaimer">disclaimer</a>.</p>
</Base>
